    "ruleCards": [
      {
        "title": "Extra Rules",
        "content": "Whenever Pantheon places a card into his discard pile by any means, he gains a Mortal Will token, up to 5. When he is at 5 Mortal Will tokens, the next card he plays is going to be empowered. After that he resets to 0 tokens. (And gains 1 when the empovered card is put into discard.) Every card in his deck has an \"Empowered:\" effect.\n\nHis hand can not be revealed, discard and card stealing effects don't affect him."
      }
    ]
